OL,3,GGrampian                               
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a 
OL,6,Flargely dry and clear evening and      
OL,7,Fnight with a widespread sharp frost. A 
OL,8,Ffew showers continuing across Buchan.  
OL,9,FLight and variable winds.              
OL,11,CSaturday:FAfter a frosty start many    
OL,12,Fplaces will have a dry, cold day with  
OL,13,Fplenty of sunshine. Still one or two   
OL,14,Fshowers across Buchan and perhaps      
OL,15,Ffurther south along the coast.         
OL,17,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry and 
OL,18,Fsunny on Sunday, overnight frost. Dry  
OL,19,Ffor most of Monday but rain likely to  
OL,20,Fspread from the west by Tuesday.       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
